      "severity": "BUG",
      "vulnSlug": "other-logic-bug",
      "title": "Free project limit is documented as 3 instead of the enforced 10",
      "description": "The guide states that Free accounts can create three projects. The owning platform defines `PLANS.free.limits.maxProjects` as 10 and the project-creation gate explicitly raises stale Free metadata to at least 10. An agent relying on this guide may incorrectly tell a user they are at capacity or recommend a paid upgrade after the third project even though seven additional projects are available.",
      "lineNumbers": [
        123,
        125,
        126
      ],
      "recommendation": "Update the documented Free limit to 10 and derive or validate published plan limits against the owning plan configuration so future entitlement changes cannot silently drift.",
